  "details": "Description\n\nThe big menu can be messed with to permanently change its orientation, even making it face away from the user, making the menu unusable\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nGo to this world (Space Drifter), open the big menu, look around to rotate yourself 90 degrees, close and reopen the big menu\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1885-81193b80fa-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-13_08-17-45.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_92dc9f55-0680-497e-9c7e-3ec8ac2e063c/1/file)",
